cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Magma in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Magma: open modelling of magma crystallization and melting"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Dougalien Systems"
version: 0.1.0
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/dougalien/magma"
abstract: >-
  Magma computes the crystallization of cooling silicate melts and the partial melting of rocks
  by Gibbs energy minimization, with the MELTS models (Ghiorso and Sack 1995) and the
  Holland and Powell igneous models (Holland, Green and Powell 2018), and a browser interface for
  teaching and research.
keywords:
  - petrology
  - igneous
  - MELTS
  - thermodynamics
  - phase equilibria
